# Copy this file to ".env" for local development (the real ".env" is git-ignored).
#
# Google Programmable Search Engine ID ("cx"). It is public by design — it is not a secret.
# Create one at https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/ (see README.md, section 4).
# Leave it as the placeholder (or remove the line) and VibeYaab simply skips Google results.
VITE_GOOGLE_CSE_ID=your_programmable_search_engine_id
